<section>
<h2>Sufficient contrast for text</h2>
<ul>
	<li>Text smaller than 24px: minimum 4,5:1</li>
	<li>Text larger than 24px: minimum 3:1</li>
	<li>Bold text of 18,5px and more: minimum 3:1</li>
	</ul>
	<aside class="notes">The ratio between sizes in points and CSS pixels is 1pt = 1.333px, therefore 14pt and 18pt are equivalent to approximately 18.5px and 24px.</aside> 
	</section>

